                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Eliza Breeze, from Liverpool, married  the violinist Felix Yaniewicz in 1800. They had three children, the two daughters being 
    musically gifted.  Godwin described her in a letter to <persName key="CUR04">W H Curran</persName> as a
    creature almost divine ( dated 2 January 1822).  There is a period 
    of close contact in 1822 between  Godwin and Mrs Yaniewicz.</p>
                        <p>See the entry for <persName key="YAN01">Felix Yaniewicz</persName></p>
                    </note>
